lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121164","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121164.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121164.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-10T18:16:36Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThanks to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121064 it is now easy to verify, that the type information on `PatternNode`s is only ever read to update itself. Thus it serves no purpose and we can remove it.\r\n\r\n- `PatternNode::type_constraint` is used in `decide_pattern_type`, but that function only updates `PatternNode::type_constraint`\r\n- It is stored into `result` in `resolve_match_pattern` but `result` is only used to store it back into `PatternNode::type_constraint`\r\n    - (`result` has one other usage, but that's in a branch where `PatternNode::type_constraint` is never stored into `result`)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/